  "body": "### Description\r\n\r\nI have seen an undocumented config option `tag` / `site_tag` in\r\nhttps://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/9af2be192a759c22d189b72cc0a7580cd9de8a37/synapse/app/homeserver.py#L86-L88\r\n- Is it used and only not good documented?\r\n  - It is mentioned in [log format](https://matrix-org.github.io/synapse/latest/usage/administration/request_log.html) in column `BBBB`\r\n- Or is it old an deprecated?\r\n- Does it make sense to document it in `listener` documentation?\r\n- And does it have other purposes than replacing the port with the tag in logging?\r\n\r\nOrigin: #187\r\n",
